chondria (PubMed:12882974). Also acts as a mitochondrial small ribosomal subunit (mt-SSU) assembly factor (PubMed:36482135)."}],"uniprot_source":"UniProtKB/Swiss-Prot Function, release 2026_04","retrieved":"2026-10-21"}],"structures":[],"alphafold_accessions":[]}